      "reading": "かのじょはかねもうけのことしかかんがえない。",
      "credits_raw": "karekano",
      "translations": [
        {
          "language": "en",
          "text": "She thinks of nothing but making money.",
          "html": "<span>She thinks of nothing but making money. </span>",
